{"findings":[{"signal":"isolated disposable execution","category":"Industry trend","status":"strong","evidence":"https://appliedtechnologyindex.com/research/2026-comparative-analysis-agent-sandbox-infrastructure/","source":"blog","detail":"The comparative report calls isolation, reproducibility, observability, interactive speed, and governance the central procurement criteria; it identifies specialist platforms, cloud primitives, and self-hosted options."},{"signal":"runtime inventory and tracing","category":"Adoption blocker","status":"strong","evidence":"https://cloudsecurityalliance.org/artifacts/enterprise-ai-security-starts-with-ai-agents","source":"survey","detail":"47% report an AI-agent security incident; 58% say detection/response takes five hours or longer. The report identifies missing real-time inventories, runtime authorization, and traceability."},{"signal":"scoped agent identity","category":"Adoption blocker","status":"strong","evidence":"https://owasp.github.io/DevSecOpsGuideline/2-Process/2-2-Develop/2-2-5-AI-Agent-and-MCP-Security/","source":"docs","detail":"OWASP recommends agent-specific, revocable identities and short-lived scoped tokens rather than developers' credentials; it also recommends separate read-only and write-capable identities."},{"signal":"network egress allowlist","category":"Adoption blocker","status":"strong","evidence":"https://owasp.github.io/DevSecOpsGuideline/2-Process/2-2-Develop/2-2-5-AI-Agent-and-MCP-Security/","source":"docs","detail":"OWASP calls allowlisted egress the main control against data exfiltration after prompt injection. CSA separately documents DNS tunneling as a viable sandbox exfiltration channel."},{"signal":"MCP configuration governance","category":"Adoption blocker","status":"strong","evidence":"https://labs.cloudsecurityalliance.org/research/csa-research-note-mcp-ai-coding-assistant-credential-theft-2/","source":"survey","detail":"CSA reports 24,008 secrets in public MCP configuration files, 2,117 still valid; it recommends treating repository-embedded MCP configurations as reviewed executable code and requiring approval before startup."},{"signal":"sandbox scope completeness","category":"Research-identified gap","status":"strong","evidence":"https://owasp.github.io/DevSecOpsGuideline/2-Process/2-2-Develop/2-2-5-AI-Agent-and-MCP-Security/","source":"docs","detail":"OWASP warns that some product sandboxes cover shell commands but not file tools or MCP servers. This favors a boundary that covers the complete agent execution path."},{"signal":"snapshot and rollback","category":"Industry trend","status":"moderate","evidence":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.12806","source":"blog","detail":"A 2025 coding-agent sandbox paper reports transactional filesystem snapshots with 100% rollback of failed states in its prototype and 14.5% overhead; it frames rollback as a way to preserve headless autonomy safely."},{"signal":"isolation patch transparency","category":"Research-identified gap","status":"moderate","evidence":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.08433","source":"blog","detail":"Comparative research finds engine classes differ materially and downstream patch lag ranges from zero days to 471+ days, opaque, or infinite. It identifies the microVM-plus-continuous-public-fuzzing combination as unoccupied."},{"signal":"safety disclosure gap","category":"Research-identified gap","status":"strong","evidence":"https://aiagentindex.mit.edu/data/2025-AI-Agent-Index.pdf","source":"survey","detail":"MIT's index finds 135 of 240 safety/evaluation/social-impact fields have no public information; only 9 of 30 agents document sandboxing or VM isolation, and only 3 document third-party testing."},{"signal":"enterprise sandbox investment","category":"Funding or acquisition signal","status":"moderate","evidence":"https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/e2b-raises-a-21m-series-a-to-offer-cloud-for-ai-agents-to-fortune-100-302514540.html","source":"competitor","detail":"E2B announced a $21M Series A in July 2025 for agent infrastructure, naming rapid secure sandboxes, secrets vaults, monitoring, and open-source interoperability as investment targets. Vendor-reported, so treat adoption claims cautiously."},{"signal":"local-first analyst demand","category":"Industry trend","status":"absent","evidence":"https://github.com/sandbaseai/sandbase-harness/","source":"competitor","detail":"Direct searches for “AI agent sandbox local-first” returned an implementation project, but no opened analyst report or developer survey quantified demand for local-first sandboxes."},{"signal":"stealth browser login","category":"Industry trend","status":"absent","evidence":"https://aiagentindex.mit.edu/data/2025-AI-Agent-Index.pdf","source":"survey","detail":"Direct searches for browser-login/authentication sandbox demand found no opened analyst, vendor-report, or survey evidence for stealth authenticated-browser login as a distinct sandbox purchasing criterion."}] }
